---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const en = Astro.url.pathname.startsWith('/en/');
---

<Base title="隐私说明 · 左二">
  <section class="page-heading">
    <h1>隐私说明</h1>
  </section>
  {en ? <div class="prose">
    <p>This is a static blog with no account system and no analytics or advertising cookies. Full-text search runs in your browser and does not send search terms to an external search service.</p>
    <p>Open-source fonts are self-hosted alongside the pages; no external font service is contacted. The hosting provider may retain request logs.</p>
    <p>Comments connect to third-party services only when Giscus is configured and you choose to load them. A GitHub account is required to participate.</p>
    <a href="/">← Back to home</a>
  </div> : <div class="prose">
    <p>
      本站为静态博客，没有账户系统，不设置分析或广告
      Cookie。全文搜索在浏览器中运行，不会将搜索词发送给站外搜索服务。
    </p>
    <p>
      本站使用自托管的开源字体，字体文件与页面由同一站点提供，不连接外部字体服务。
      站点托管服务可能记录请求日志。
    </p>
    <p>
      评论仅在配置 Giscus 并由读者主动点击加载时连接第三方服务，参与讨论需要
      GitHub 账户。
    </p>
    <a href="/">← 返回首页</a>
  </div>}
</Base>
